  "vibe": "Crema #fdf3e0 paper, chile red #d93425, corn yellow #f2c14b and a teal #2a9d8f truck. Boogaloo shouts every title in caps at up to 152px on the bounciest entrance here — a 110px drop with an overshoot — while Nunito keeps the prices legible. The world is a street corner: papel picado strung on a sagging line, nine flags swaying out of phase with zigzag fringes; a teal taco truck bouncing on its suspension three times a second under a red awning with corn scallops, smoke looping from the stack; a teal cactus; three red chiles tumbling. Highest rotation in the set (1.4), a spin move, and the busiest world clock (2.0). Its beats: a dotted-leader menu board whose prices flicker as they land, a clicking pointer, popping pill alerts, and a heat card flung off the stack under a stamp.",
